==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===

* [[syngje]] (e infinitive)
* [[synga]] (bracket form), [[synge]] (bracket form; also Norwegian Bokmål)

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|nn}} {{term|syngja|lang=non}}, {{term|syngva|lang=non}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nn}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*singwaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|nn}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*sengʷh-}}.

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-irreg|syng|song|sunge}}

# [[sing]]
#: ''Eg har ikkje '''sunge''' denne songen på årevis.''
#:: I haven't '''sung''' this song for years.
# [[echo]], [[boom]]

